1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Kofflard starts with one question: who do you like?

2
00:00:04,733 --> 00:00:07,873
Type De Dijk, at the bottom, right under your thumb.

3
00:00:07,878 --> 00:00:10,994
Eleven musicians, from safe to wild.

4
00:00:10,998 --> 00:00:14,234
Safe: Doe Maar, from the same Dutch stages.

5
00:00:14,234 --> 00:00:18,470
Curious: Boudewijn de Groot, older and quieter.

6
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:21,812
And wild: Solomon Burke, American soul.

7
00:00:21,824 --> 00:00:26,316
Every wild one says why: he made a whole album with De Dijk.

8
00:00:30,319 --> 00:00:33,203
Tap More, and the list starts again from there.

9
00:00:33,212 --> 00:00:35,488
Now everything starts from Doe Maar.

10
00:00:35,492 --> 00:00:39,824
And the wild ones lead to their roots: the ska of The Specials.

11
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:42,842
One tap takes you back to De Dijk.

12
00:00:44,077 --> 00:00:46,641
Something else entirely: Eminem.

13
00:00:47,587 --> 00:00:50,607
Dido? He built Stan on her song.

14
00:00:52,329 --> 00:00:57,269
Too wild today? Switch Wild off, and the wild ones step aside.

15
00:00:57,269 --> 00:00:59,737
And back on, when you are curious again.

16
00:00:59,982 --> 00:01:04,252
One tap opens YouTube, or Spotify, or YouTube Music.

17
00:01:08,479 --> 00:01:10,757
Like one? Star it.

18
00:01:16,234 --> 00:01:18,094
Wherever your search takes you.

19
00:01:24,653 --> 00:01:26,875
And find them all again in your favourites.

20
00:01:28,523 --> 00:01:32,503
Kofflard. Find the music you did not know you were looking for.

